{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"feb08b9a448a6d8849ead791b305b99aa373ff61cc0aae0e1cd0cc54993789dc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大祭司的异象"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["天使",{"noteId":4},"又指给我看：大祭司约书亚站在耶和华的使者面前；撒但也站在约书亚的右边，与他作对。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和华向撒但说：「撒但哪，耶和华责备你！就是拣选耶路撒冷的耶和华责备你！这不是从火中抽出来的一根柴吗？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["约书亚穿着污秽的衣服站在使者面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["使者吩咐站在面前的说：「你们要脱去他污秽的衣服」；又对约书亚说：「我使你脱离罪孽，要给你穿上华美的衣服。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我说：「要将洁净的冠冕戴在他头上。」他们就把洁净的冠冕戴在他头上，给他穿上华美的衣服，耶和华的使者在旁边站立。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华的使者告诫约书亚说："]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["「万军之耶和华如此说：你若遵行我的道，谨守我的命令，你就可以管理我的家，看守我的院宇；我也要使你在这些站立的人中间来往。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["大祭司约书亚啊，你和坐在你面前的同伴都当听。（他们是作预兆的。）我必使我仆人大卫的苗裔发出。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["看哪，我在约书亚面前所立的石头，在一块石头上有七眼。万军之耶和华说：我要亲自雕刻这石头，并要在一日之间除掉这地的罪孽。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["当那日，你们各人要请邻舍坐在葡萄树和无花果树下。这是万军之耶和华说的。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"原文是他","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}